flowchart TD
    spec["Reviewed business contract<br/>independently labeled expected outcomes"]
    proposal["Bounded scenario proposal<br/>AI or fixed templates<br/>pinned prompt / seed / budget"]
    runner["Typed legal-scenario runner<br/>controlled local scheduler<br/>no arbitrary generated code"]
    target["Owned vulnerable / corrected fixture<br/>Assembly + PayGuard + merchant worker"]
    fault["Local fault hooks<br/>response drop / crash / event redelivery<br/>concurrent dispatch / stale offer"]
    provider["Mode explicitly chosen<br/>synthetic model / recorded adapter<br/>or real PayPal Sandbox"]
    trace["Observed event history<br/>source provenance and causal IDs"]
    oracle["Independent oracle<br/>history properties + reference expectations<br/>pass / fail / invalid / inconclusive"]
    reduce["Trace reducer<br/>preserve prerequisites and same failure<br/>no global-minimum claim"]
    export["Postman + runner manifest<br/>code and contract versions<br/>fails before / passes after fix"]
    spec --> proposal
    proposal --> runner
    runner --> target
    fault --> target
    target --> provider
    target --> trace
    provider -->|independent resource observations| trace
    spec --> oracle
    trace --> oracle
    oracle -->|verified failure| reduce
    reduce -.->|controlled rerun| runner
    reduce --> export
